   "stem_html": "<p>The Fairfax location’s regional manager wants to know the maximum of the units sold per order, and the minimum FOB $. Use functions to find these values.</p>\n\n<table>\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th>Date</th>\n    <th>Agent</th>\n    <th>Item Description</th>\n    <th>Quantity</th>\n    <th>FOB$</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/29/2021</td>\n    <td>Antonio</td>\n    <td>Tablets, 7in</td>\n    <td>143</td>\n    <td>$10,582.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/27/2021</td>\n    <td>Izabelle</td>\n    <td>Computer Server Accessories</td>\n    <td>2500</td>\n    <td>$21,350.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/22/2021</td>\n    <td>Antonio</td>\n    <td>Headphones</td>\n    <td>542</td>\n    <td>$26,016.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/21/2021</td>\n    <td>Izabelle</td>\n    <td>LED TVs, 55in and 65in</td>\n    <td>53</td>\n    <td>$14,575.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/17/2021</td>\n    <td>James</td>\n    <td>LCD TVs, 32in and 45in</td>\n    <td>97</td>\n    <td>$64,505.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/15/2021</td>\n    <td>James</td>\n    <td>Cellular Phone Accessories</td>\n    <td>3000</td>\n    <td>$22,920.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/10/2021</td>\n    <td>Antonio</td>\n    <td>Home Stereo Systems</td>\n    <td>74</td>\n    <td>$7,252.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/7/2021</td>\n    <td>Izabelle</td>\n    <td>Blu-Ray Players</td>\n    <td>127</td>\n    <td>$10,922.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>3/5/2021</td>\n    <td>James</td>\n    <td>HDTV Antennas</td>\n    <td>768</td>\n    <td>$21,504.00</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"right\"><b>Max Units</b></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"right\"><b>Min $</b></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n    <td></td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
